{"words": [{"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تَأْكُلُوٓا۟", "translation": "eat"}, {"text": "أَمْوَٰلَكُم", "translation": "your properties"}, {"text": "بَيْنَكُم", "translation": "among yourselves"}, {"text": "بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ", "translation": "wrongfully"}, {"text": "وَتُدْلُوا۟", "translation": "and present"}, {"text": "بِهَآ", "translation": "[with] it"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "ٱلْحُكَّامِ", "translation": "the authorities"}, {"text": "لِتَأْكُلُوا۟", "translation": "so that you may eat"}, {"text": "فَرِيقًۭا", "translation": "a portion"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "أَمْوَٰلِ", "translation": "(the) wealth"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "(of) the people"}, {"text": "بِٱلْإِثْمِ", "translation": "sinfully"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "while you"}, {"text": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}], "sahih": "And do not consume one another's wealth unjustly or send it [in bribery] to the rulers in order that [they might aid] you [to] consume a portion of the wealth of the people in sin, while you know [it is unlawful]."}